    "title": "Effort in several directions",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-phrases-r5-01-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Effort in several directions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "These constrained paired frames depict repeated questions or effort in different directions. Use compatible verbs; they are not a recipe for freely combining any two verbs.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他问这问那，想了解清楚。",
                "pinyin": "tā wèn zhè wèn nà ， xiǎng liǎojiě qīngchu 。",
                "meaning": "He asks about this and that, trying to understand clearly.",
                "audio": "7b08f1a5f655339056f93061c6933284924fb05a8be7cd3c93a012086cce50da"
              },
              {
                "text": "他左查右问，终于找到了。",
                "pinyin": "tā zuǒ chá yòu wèn ， zhōngyú zhǎodào le 。",
                "meaning": "He checked and asked in every direction, and finally found it.",
                "audio": "a6a3d15eb052ee3be71778922c0021f52b8b1ffa3217a81aee4c12903ca5dbb9"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
